sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner
    participant Scout
    participant Designer
    participant Thread
    Owner->>Scout: Prepare a campaign for review
    Scout->>Designer: Create the carousel assets
    Designer-->>Scout: Draft assets and notes
    Scout->>Thread: Post draft and review choices
    Thread-->>Owner: Show the draft inline
    alt Changes requested
      Owner->>Thread: Choose changes and add feedback
      Thread->>Scout: Deliver the signed response
      Scout->>Designer: Revise the selected assets
      Designer-->>Scout: Return the next version
      Scout->>Thread: Post revised draft with history
    else Approved
      Owner->>Thread: Approve this version
      Thread->>Scout: Deliver the signed approval
      Scout->>Thread: Record the confirmed outcome
      Thread-->>Owner: Show the receipt
    end
